  "Each value describes one packet sent before the handshake, as a sequence of tags: <b 0x...> static bytes, <t> a 4-byte timestamp, <r N> random bytes, <rc N> random letters, <rd N> random digits (N up to 1000). Example: <b 0xd100000001><rc 8><t><r 50>. These are client-only parameters, they are never written into the server config; empty values are skipped, and an empty I1 turns the whole set off. Keep each packet under about 1472 bytes or it is fragmented on the way out, which is the signature this is meant to avoid. A config that grows past the QR code limit can still be downloaded as a file.": "每个值描述握手之前发送的一个数据包，由一串标签组成：<b 0x...> 静态字节，<t> 4 字节时间戳，<r N> 随机字节，<rc N> 随机字母，<rd N> 随机数字（N 最大为 1000）。示例：<b 0xd100000001><rc 8><t><r 50>。这些是仅客户端参数，永远不会写入服务器配置；空值会被跳过，而 I1 为空会关闭整套设置。请让每个数据包保持在约 1472 字节以下，否则它在发出时会被分片，而这正是要避免的特征。即使配置超出了二维码的限制，也仍然可以下载为文件。",
