  "Subnet, MTU, DNS, endpoint and the AmneziaWG 3.1 obfuscation parameters are generated automatically. Tick \"Advanced settings\" to fill them in yourself.": "子网、MTU、DNS、端点和 AmneziaWG 3.1 混淆参数都会自动生成。勾选「高级设置」可自行填写。",
