  "Suspend \"{{.Name}}\"? The client loses its connection until reactivated.": "停用「{{.Name}}」？该客户端在重新启用前会失去连接。",
  "The AmneziaVPN app replaces the MTU with {{.AppMTU}} on import. After importing, set MTU to {{.MTU}} in the app's AmneziaWG connection settings, or import the .conf instead - it keeps the MTU": "AmneziaVPN 应用在导入时会把 MTU 替换成 {{.AppMTU}}。导入后请在应用的 AmneziaWG 连接设置中把 MTU 设为 {{.MTU}}，或者改为导入 .conf 文件——它会保留 MTU",
  "The placeholders are what the engine accepts, not what is wise. On top of them S1 must fit MTU-148, S2 must fit MTU-92, S1+56 must not equal S2, and H1-H4 must all differ.": "这些占位值是引擎接受的范围，而不是推荐值。除此之外：S1 必须小于 MTU-148，S2 必须小于 MTU-92，S1+56 不得等于 S2，并且 H1-H4 必须互不相同。",
  "These defaults are used for new clients when \"Apply I-settings\" is enabled.": "启用「应用 I-设置」时，新建客户端会使用这些默认值。",
